        <paragraph>Rewrite the following expressions in terms of exponentials and simplify.</paragraph>
        <paragraph>a. $$2\cosh \left( {\ln x} \right)$$ b. $$\cosh 4x + \sinh 4x$$ c. $$\cosh 2x - \sinh 2x$$ d. $$\ln \left( {\cosh x + \sinh x} \right) + \ln \left( {\cosh x - \sinh x} \right)$$</paragraph>
